message: "If you use this software, cite the repository and the specific released version."
title: "sCO2-BraytonBench"
type: software
version: "0.5.0a0"
authors:
  - family-names: Sivaprasadan
    given-names: Abhijith
repository-code: "https://github.com/Open-Energy-Methods/sco2-braytonbench"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
abstract: "Alpha-stage numerical research software for quasi-steady sCO2 Brayton cycles, finite-source thermal transients and a synthetic constant-property 1-D two-temperature sensible packed-bed TES benchmark, with mathematical verification and a leakage-controlled output surrogate whose OOD limitations are disclosed. No experimental TES or CARBOSOLA plant validation or independent v1.0 sign-off."
